@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:5170/api

### List product reviews
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/1/reviews

### Get one review by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/1/reviews/1

### Submit a review for a product in a completed order
POST {{baseUrl}}/products/1/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "orderId": 1,
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "Sản phẩm hoạt động tốt, đóng gói cẩn thận.",
  "imageUrl": null
}

### Rejected: a product must belong to the user's completed order
POST {{baseUrl}}/products/1/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "orderId": 999999,
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "Đơn không tồn tại hoặc chưa giao thành công."
}
